Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 16:30:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Studio: admit ROCm flash attention under auto by a
 whole-block timing probe, not a family table

auto on ROCm with a verified flash_attn now yields a candidate that apply_attention_backend resolves by timing one
synthetic DiT block (LayerNorm, QKV, attention, out proj, 4x MLP) at the loaded model's attention geometry with native
SDPA vs flash_attn, admitting flash only when it is at least 3% faster and the block output matches (rel L1 <= 2e-2).
Cached per (device, dtype, geometry). Replaces the flux.2-klein / gfx11 table. Kill switch
UNSLOTH_DIFFUSION_ROCM_FLASH=auto|0|1 (0: auto never picks flash; 1: verified is enough, no timing).
